{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Bacterian!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden deep inside, our immune system is locked in a constant fight against germs and pathogens, ensuring we stay strong and healthy. Bacterian lets you experience this struggle firsthand in an exciting action-puzzle take on the classic Sokoban-like gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/82ec0e568532306310c4fc0a0d37fb8b.avif?t=1757574654\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/7a83612ede18465c595f6def4c9530a6.poster.avif?t=1757574654\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/7a83612ede18465c595f6def4c9530a6.webm?t=1757574654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/7a83612ede18465c595f6def4c9530a6.mp4?t=1757574654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to stay alive, you have to keep moving. Always!\u00a0Be quick with your tactics and outsmart the hostile pathogens. Put blocks in their way to change their paths, use teleports or trap them in closed areas - all this to finish them off before they catch and infect you.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/d623b1633dfc4f154bfeb80b36b164b5.avif?t=1757574654\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/31023d88ccadaafc3486b10ad74d615c.poster.avif?t=1757574654\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/31023d88ccadaafc3486b10ad74d615c.webm?t=1757574654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/31023d88ccadaafc3486b10ad74d615c.mp4?t=1757574654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a fearless Immune Cell, you can fight back!\u00a0Squash the pesky invaders by sliding blocks onto them and make sure to get rid of them all.\u00a0Be careful\u00a0though - germs vary in looks, intelligence, abilities and speed, so every encounter requires quite a different approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/7f275a5f98ec65129121424a0c6736ba.avif?t=1757574654\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/c5b1888984b8c790749f3f699491b7ed.poster.avif?t=1757574654\" width=780 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/c5b1888984b8c790749f3f699491b7ed.webm?t=1757574654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/c5b1888984b8c790749f3f699491b7ed.mp4?t=1757574654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse levels set throughout every corner of your body... and beyond!\u00a0Defend not only yourself, but also your animal friends. Remember - the further you go, the more advanced mechanics and solutions you'll face.\u00a0Can you overcome troublesome diseases once and for all and keep everyone safe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/d67f688be295bcf12ca57f7a0c58b2f6.avif?t=1757574654\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 The fan favorite, evergreen\u00a0Sokoban-like gameplay\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Clear pixel art graphics allowing you to fully focus on action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Music and sound effects that spark a wave of 8bit nostalgia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Numerous varied levels with level editor, enemies and mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Easy to play / hard to master approach, allowing you to utilize many different strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take care, stay healthy and play Bacterian!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/c3dc2389d40001f393a344014de0d5d7.avif?t=1757574654\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570450?t=1757574654","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3570450?t=1757574654","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/13da40417a754dfa4e5e0f9e6afd8114f1912694/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757574654","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/13da40417a754dfa4e5e0f9e6afd8114f1912694/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757574654","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"i