s you'll face.\u00a0Can you overcome troublesome diseases once and for all and keep everyone safe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/d67f688be295bcf12ca57f7a0c58b2f6.avif?t=1757574654\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 The fan favorite, evergreen\u00a0Sokoban-like gameplay\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Clear pixel art graphics allowing you to fully focus on action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Music and sound effects that spark a wave of 8bit nostalgia</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Numerous varied levels with level editor, enemies and mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Easy to play / hard to master approach, allowing you to utilize many different strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take care, stay healthy and play Bacterian!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/extras/c3dc2389d40001f393a344014de0d5d7.avif?t=1757574654\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p>","developers":["Error 300"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570450/4f8dc348d7f3fa799d396fe3773cb1100b7a3958/header.jpg?t=1757574654","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or AMD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA Geforce GTX 1050</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>